<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>05 · DEPLOYMENT</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            从一台笔记本到一台 NAS，都有对应的跑法
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 216, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, height: 156 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方式一</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 6 }}>一键脚本安装</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        Linux / macOS / Windows 各自一条命令，自动创建隔离的 Python 3.12 环境。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 216, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, height: 196 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方式二</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 6 }}>Docker Compose</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        官方编排文件开箱可用，另有国内镜像加速版与 PostgreSQL 版，生产环境推荐。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 216, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, height: 236 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方式三</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 6 }}>注册为系统服务</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        支持 systemd、launchd 与 Windows 服务，开机自启；内置自更新，升级后自动重启恢复。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 216, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#D6E4F9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, height: 276 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方式四</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 6 }}>桌面客户端与 NAS</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        Windows / macOS / Linux 原生安装包，飞牛 FnOS 另提供原生与容器两种包；图形界面即可完成安装，不需要终端。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 216, justifyContent: 'flex-end' }}>
                <Box style={{ background: '#FFF7E9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#F5D9A4', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, height: 316 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方式五</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3, marginTop: 6 }}>随时随地的访问</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#92400E', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        控制台支持 PWA 安装与移动端适配，配合内建 ACME 自动签发证书，可安全地对外提供 HTTPS 访问。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                上线路径不依赖任何云厂商：试点可以在一台电脑上完成，规模扩大时再迁到容器与集群，配置与数据可平滑带走。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
